*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_Auto_Rmod_Blackbox_5_Verification
    [Documentation]
    ...  The purpose of this test case is verification of new blackbox v5.0 content for RMODs.
    ...  Checked blackbox files are stored in 3 folders in logs directory: blackbox_files, blackbox_files_reset,
    ...  blackbox_files_alarm. The test case requires the list of expected SOC version for every RMOD which will be
    ...  verified.
    ...  The test case verifies the following:
    ...  1) Blackbox structure correctness (presence of all required fields for soc family version, hw information,
    ...     temperature data, diagnostic test data, isti data, resets data, memory load data, cpu load data,
    ...     votage data, optical lvl signal data, sw version)
    ...  2) SOC version of the RMOD (blackbox SOC version should be equal to the expected SOC version)
    ...  3) Product code of the RMOD (blackbox product code should be equal to the product code from WEBEM)
    ...  4) Serial number of the RMOD (blackbox serial number should be equal to the serial number from WEBEM)
    ...  5) Temperature data of the RMOD (blackbox temperature data should have entries for 'Ranges', 'Values' and
    ...     'Last 90 days' fields, occurence's count should be digits and sum of all occurences for 90 days should not
    ...     be greater than 2160[24 x 90])
    ...  6) Reset data (reset counter in blackbox file after reset is equal to reset counter before reset + 1,
    ...     reset date [0] before reset is equal to reset date [1] after reset and reset date [0] after reset is newer
    ...     than reset date [0] before reset)
    ...  7) SW version (blackbox SW name and version should be equal to the SW version from the output of
    ...     'SWmanShellCommand -i' command on the RMOD)
    ...  8) Alarm history (blackbox alarm history should contain the alarm with the expected fault id and fault
    ...     occurrence date should be newer than the last date from blackbox before alarm triggering)
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param list of str rmod_soc_family_version: (Mandatory) :
    ...         Expected SOC family version for every RMOD which will be verified, please provide the names in RMOD
    ...         order (the same as in rmod_indexes list)
    ...         Example: ['Mars', 'Mars']
    ...  :param list of int rmod_indexes: (Optional) :
    ...         List of RMOD indexes to verify. If not provided, all RMODs will be verified
    ...         Example: [1, 2]
    ...  :param str rmod_blackbox_path: (Optional) :
    ...         Path to the RMOD's blackbox file.
    ...         Default value: '/mnt/runtime'
    ...  :param str blackbox_file_name: (Optional) :
    ...         Name of the RMOD's blackbox file.
    ...         Default value: 'BBOX5'
    ...  :param str alarm_rmod_command: (Optional) :
    ...         Command to trigger alarm on the RMOD which will be checked.
    ...         Default value: 'echo out > /sys/class/gpio/gpio415/direction'
    ...  :param int expected_fault_id: (Optional) :
    ...         Expected fault id of the alarm which will be checked.
    ...         Default value: 1926
    ...  :param str expected_fault_name: (Optional) :
    ...         Expected fault name of the alarm which will be checked.
    ...         Default value: 'Radio autonomous reset as recovery action'
    [Arguments]                                     ${rmod_soc_family_version}
    ...                                             ${rmod_indexes}=${None}
    ...                                             ${rmod_blackbox_path}=/mnt/runtime
    ...                                             ${blackbox_file_name}=BBOX5
    ...                                             ${alarm_rmod_command}=echo out > /sys/class/gpio/gpio415/direction
    ...                                             ${expected_fault_id}=1926
    ...                                             ${expected_fault_name}=Radio autonomous reset as recovery action

    Robot Log Operation                             Creating path for blackbox files...
    ${blackbox_path}                                Set variable    ${logs_path}/blackbox_files
    ${blackbox_path_after_reset}                    Set variable    ${logs_path}/blackbox_files_reset
    ${blackbox_path_with_alarm}                     Set variable    ${logs_path}/blackbox_files_alarm
    logs.create_dir_if_doesnt_exist                 dir_path=${blackbox_path}
    logs.create_dir_if_doesnt_exist                 dir_path=${blackbox_path_after_reset}
    logs.create_dir_if_doesnt_exist                 dir_path=${blackbox_path_with_alarm}

    ${bts_type}=                                    hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    Create admin session with default alias         bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${connection}=                                  connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${rmod_indexes}=                                Run keyword if      ${rmod_indexes}
    ...                                             Set variable
    ...                                             ${rmod_indexes}
    ...                                             ELSE
    ...                                             admin_info_model.get_rmod_indexes
    ...                                             connection=${connection}

    FOR    ${index}    ${rmod_index}    IN ENUMERATE    @{rmod_indexes}
        Robot Log Operation                         Verifying Blackbox content for RMOD-${rmod_index}...

        ${basic_bbox_filepath}=                     rmod_operations.get_file_from_rmod_with_rmod_index
        ...                                         rmod_index=${rmod_index}
        ...                                         download_path=${blackbox_path}
        ...                                         connection=${connection}
        ...                                         rmod_path=${rmod_blackbox_path}
        ...                                         rmod_file_name=${blackbox_file_name}

        Check Blackbox Structure Correctness        path_to_blackbox_file=${basic_bbox_filepath}

        Check Blackbox Rmod Soc Family Version      path_to_blackbox_file=${basic_bbox_filepath}
        ...                                         expected_soc_family_version=${rmod_soc_family_version}[${index}]

        Check Blackbox Rmod Product Code            path_to_blackbox_file=${basic_bbox_filepath}
        ...                                         rmod_id=${rmod_index}
        ...                                         connection=${connection}

        Check Blackbox Rmod Serial Number           path_to_blackbox_file=${basic_bbox_filepath}
        ...                                         rmod_id=${rmod_index}
        ...                                         connection=${connection}

        Check Blackbox Rmod Temperature Data        path_to_blackbox_file=${basic_bbox_filepath}

        Reset RMOD and wait for it to be available
        ...                                         rmod_id=${rmod_index}
        ...                                         connection=${connection}
        ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
        Sleep                                       300s
        ...                                         reason=Waiting for RMOD's blackbox to be updated after reset...
        ${reset_bbox_filepath}=                     rmod_operations.get_file_from_rmod_with_rmod_index
        ...                                         rmod_index=${rmod_index}
        ...                                         download_path=${blackbox_path_after_reset}
        ...                                         connection=${connection}
        ...                                         rmod_path=${rmod_blackbox_path}
        ...                                         rmod_file_name=${blackbox_file_name}
        Check Blackbox Reset Counters               path_to_bbox_file_before_reset=${basic_bbox_filepath}
        ...                                         path_to_bbox_file_after_reset=${reset_bbox_filepath}

        Check SW Version In Blackbox                path_to_blackbox_file=${reset_bbox_filepath}
        ...                                         rmod_id=${rmod_index}
        ...                                         connection=${connection}

        Alarms.Allow alarm                          fault_id=${expected_fault_id}
        ...                                         fault_name=${expected_fault_name}
        ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
        Generate Alarm And Check Blackbox Alarm History
        ...                                         path_to_bbox_file_before_alarm=${reset_bbox_filepath}
        ...                                         alarm_rmod_command=${alarm_rmod_command}
        ...                                         expected_fault_id=${expected_fault_id}
        ...                                         expected_fault_name=${expected_fault_name}
        ...                                         rmod_id=${rmod_index}
        ...                                         connection=${connection}
        ...                                         download_path=${blackbox_path_with_alarm}
        ...                                         rmod_blackbox_path=${rmod_blackbox_path}
        ...                                         blackbox_file_name=${blackbox_file_name}
        ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
        Alarms.Disallow alarm                       fault_id=${expected_fault_id}
        ...                                         fault_name=${expected_fault_name}
        ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}

        Robot Log Result                            Validation of blackbox content for RMOD-${rmod_index} has been completed!
        ...                                         to_console=${True}
    END
